<title>USA: San Jose FA, Calif., won by Painemebber Inc. [CORRECTED 22:05 GMT]</title>
<headline>San Jose FA, Calif., won by Painemebber Inc. [CORRECTED 22:05 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Painewebber Inc said it won $9.765 million of San Jose Financing Authority, Calif., 1997 lease revenue bonds, Series B, with a true interest cost of 4.6599 percent.</p>
<p>(Corrects winner from Smith Barney to Painewebber Inc and true interest cost from 4.638 to 4.6599.)</p>
</text>
